{"path":"docs/aidlc/modules/project/inception/user-stories.md","content":"# US-001 Ordered export

As an internal order consumer, I export the complete ordered list as pages of 50. REQ-001 and AC-001 govern all boundaries, exact values, a single fetch, original failure identity and independent calls. No UI is applicable.
","sha256":"57da48014a14045bcd47d27d559cd35d305a9e43948943692e4473e836b079f4"}

